---
/* Homepage "Features" section. */
---
<section class="hpSec" id="hpFeatures">
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <div class="hpGrid">
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Brushes &amp; pencils</h3><p>Pencil, 11 brush styles, eraser and highlighter with size, color and opacity controls.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Shapes</h3><p>17 shapes — lines, arrows, stars, hearts and more — that stay editable until you finish them.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Stickers &amp; emojis</h3><p>36 vector stickers, hundreds of color emojis and 88 black-and-white coloring-book outlines.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Text tool</h3><p>Add words in 5 fun fonts, then move, resize and rotate them.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Paper &amp; patterns</h3><p>Colored paper and patterns including coordinate graph paper for little mathematicians.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Save &amp; print</h3><p>Zoom bar, A4 print-area guide, and one-tap PNG or PDF export.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Autosave</h3><p>Your drawing is saved in the browser automatically as you work.</p></div>
    <div class="hpCard"><h3>Draw together</h3><p>Rooms let a whole class draw at once — the creator can pause or remove collaborators anytime.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
